          <details xmi:id="_SYpDoJXHEeqqGZh46IEtXQ" key="gmm-documentation" value="&lt;p&gt;RoomTypes (within a Hotel) will have one or more Rooms of that type which can be Booked.&amp;nbsp; A Hotel could have zero Rooms of a specific RoomType but then Bookings would be able to made for any rooms.&amp;nbsp; I.e. it is insufficient to have a RoomType without any Rooms in a working system although technically possible.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;"/>
        </eAnnotations>
      </xmi:Extension>
